# T10: seeded random walks of tools, clicks, drags, keys, undo and redo on the
# fixture. Nothing asserts, the selection always resolves, and undoing
# everything gives back the mission byte for byte.
open $RWSMAN_UI_FIXTURE/Maps/M1/M1.scn
remember mission.hash
monkey 1 150
undo-all
wait idle
expect-same mission.hash
monkey 2 150
undo-all
wait idle
expect-same mission.hash
monkey 3 150
undo-all
wait idle
expect-same mission.hash
